  "turns": [
    {
      "probe": "How much humanitarian funding is tracked globally each year?",
      "text": "The global humanitarian funding tracked annually comes from the Office for the Coordination of Humanitarian Affairs (OCHA) Financial Tracking Service (FTS), which provides data through the Centre for Humanitarian Data's HDX HAPI. This dataset includes cumulative appeal requirements and funding received, but it moves throughout the year as new information is added.\n\nFor the most recent figures on global humanitarian funding, please refer to the latest OCHA FTS report or visit their website directly for up-to-date statistics. The exact amount can vary significantly from one reporting period to another due to ongoing changes in appeals and contributions.",
